# Fork publishing identity

The user has authorized this fork under DrazorV. Commits use DrazorV and the
GitHub noreply address configured locally. Verify the origin remote and the
authenticated GitHub login before publishing: both must target DrazorV.
The upstream remote is for fetching; do not push to it without a separate request.

Never publish private keys, account tokens, raw vehicle captures, unmasked VINs,
personal email addresses, or local machine paths. Inspect the staged file list
and diff before every commit. Preserve the original MIT copyright notice.
